#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service {#ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service {#ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find the latest package release summaries and platform updates from IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service on this page.\n"
msgstr "Temukan ringkasan rilis paket terbaru dan pembaruan platform dari IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service di halaman ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"platform-sep26\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "September 2026 {#september-2026}"
msgstr "September 2026 {#september-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The first Nighthawk r2 QPU is now available** &mdash; Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to `ibm_phoenix`, the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r2 QPU and our fastest processor yet. `ibm_phoenix` is a high-connectivity, square-lattice 120-programmable-qubit device that delivers up to 25× higher throughput than Heron while matching its fidelity. \n"
msgstr "**QPU Nighthawk r2 pertama kini tersedia** &mdash; Premium, Flex, dan Pay-As-You-Go Plan kini memiliki akses ke `ibm_phoenix`, QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk r2 pertama dan prosesor tercepat kami sejauh ini. `ibm_phoenix` adalah perangkat 120-qubit yang dapat diprogram dengan konektivitas tinggi berbentuk square-lattice yang memberikan throughput hingga 25× lebih tinggi dibandingkan Heron sambil menyamai fidelitasnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The gains come from a newly introduced independent high-speed reset that returns every programmable qubit to the ground state faster and more completely. As a result, the default repetition delay is 1 µs (previously 250 µs), which pushes throughput above 100,000 Max Circuits Per Second (MCPS). For more about how IBM tracks quantum hardware performance across metrics of scale, quality, and speed, see [this blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/hardware-metrics-2026).\n"
msgstr "  Peningkatan ini berasal dari reset berkecepatan tinggi independen yang baru diperkenalkan yang mengembalikan setiap qubit yang dapat diprogram ke ground state dengan lebih cepat dan lebih lengkap. Akibatnya, penundaan repetisi default adalah 1 µs (sebelumnya 250 µs), yang mendorong throughput di atas 100.000 Max Circuits Per Second (MCPS). Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang bagaimana IBM melacak performa hardware kuantum di berbagai metrik skala, kualitas, dan kecepatan, lihat [blog ini](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/hardware-metrics-2026).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The increased speed and connectivity make it possible to do more usable work from the same capacity, with the largest, most demanding workloads benefitting the most. Larger experiments, broader parameter sweeps, and methods that were once too costly at scale are now practical to run routinely.\n"
msgstr "  Kecepatan dan konektivitas yang meningkat ini memungkinkan lebih banyak pekerjaan yang bermanfaat dilakukan dari kapasitas yang sama, dengan beban kerja terbesar dan paling menuntut mendapatkan manfaat paling besar. Eksperimen yang lebih besar, sapuan parameter yang lebih luas, dan metode yang dulunya terlalu mahal dalam skala besar kini praktis untuk dijalankan secara rutin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `ibm_phoenix` is also built for the next era of quantum error correction research. Alongside high-speed reset, it supports mid-circuit reset and dynamic circuits for real-time control over error correction.\n"
msgstr "  `ibm_phoenix` juga dibangun untuk era berikutnya dari riset koreksi error kuantum. Selain reset berkecepatan tinggi, ia mendukung mid-circuit reset dan dynamic circuits untuk kontrol real-time atas koreksi error.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"platform-aug26\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2026 {#august-2026}"
msgstr "Agustus 2026 {#august-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updates to IBM Quantum Platform** &mdash; A recent update to IBM Quantum Platform makes it easier to understand your job results, unlocks powerful new circuit design capabilities in Composer, and keeps you informed about your usage limits — so you can focus more on your quantum work.\n"
msgstr "**Pembaruan pada IBM Quantum Platform** &mdash; Pembaruan terbaru pada IBM Quantum Platform membuatnya lebih mudah untuk memahami hasil job Anda, membuka kemampuan desain circuit baru yang canggih di Composer, dan menjaga Anda tetap mendapat informasi tentang batas penggunaan Anda — sehingga Anda dapat lebih fokus pada pekerjaan kuantum Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job results & workloads  \n"
msgstr "Hasil job & beban kerja  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bit-by-bit outcomes view** — a new way to view Sampler measurement results, breaking down outcomes bit by bit instead of by full state. Useful as an alternative to the Measurement outcomes view when results contain many distinct states.  \n"
msgstr "**Tampilan hasil bit demi bit** — cara baru untuk melihat hasil pengukuran Sampler, memecah hasil bit demi bit alih-alih berdasarkan state penuh. Berguna sebagai alternatif untuk tampilan Measurement outcomes ketika hasil mengandung banyak state yang berbeda.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit timing chart** — shows a scheduled timeline of a circuit's operations (gates, channels, durations). Available for Sampler and Executor jobs. Requires [enabling timing data retrieval](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing#enable-timing-data-retrieval).  \n"
msgstr "**Grafik pewaktuan circuit** — menampilkan garis waktu terjadwal dari operasi circuit (gate, channel, durasi). Tersedia untuk job Sampler dan Executor. Memerlukan [mengaktifkan pengambilan data pewaktuan](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing#enable-timing-data-retrieval).  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Chunk/span execution diagnostics panel** — a new panel on job details showing chunk- and span-level execution diagnostics. See [Sampler input/output](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/sampler-input-output) for what this data means and how to enable it when submitting jobs.  \n"
msgstr "**Panel diagnostik eksekusi chunk/span** — panel baru pada detail job yang menampilkan diagnostik eksekusi tingkat chunk dan span. Lihat [Sampler input/output](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/sampler-input-output) untuk mengetahui arti data ini dan cara mengaktifkannya saat mengirimkan job.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Device calibration data at a glance** — job details now show the device calibration data from the time of submission or execution via a \"View calibration history\" link.  \n"
msgstr "**Data kalibrasi perangkat sekilas** — detail job sekarang menampilkan data kalibrasi perangkat dari waktu pengiriman atau eksekusi melalui tautan \"View calibration history\".  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Executor results visualization** — job details pages now render results for Executor jobs. See the [Directed execution model (beta)](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/directed-execution-model) guide for more on Executor.  \n"
msgstr "**Visualisasi hasil Executor** — halaman detail job sekarang menampilkan hasil untuk job Executor. Lihat panduan [Directed execution model (beta)](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/directed-execution-model) untuk info lebih lanjut tentang Executor.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dynamic circuits now render on job details** — with OpenQASM 3.0 support in Composer (see more below), circuits that previously failed to render (for example, those using dynamic circuits) now display correctly on the job details page.  \n"
msgstr "**Circuit dinamis kini bisa dirender pada detail job** — dengan dukungan OpenQASM 3.0 di Composer (lihat lebih lanjut di bawah), circuit yang sebelumnya gagal dirender (misalnya, yang menggunakan circuit dinamis) sekarang tampil dengan benar di halaman detail job.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Histogram improvements** — faster loading, smoother zoom in/out, and a new selection tool for narrowing in on specific result ranges.  \n"
msgstr "**Peningkatan histogram** — pemuatan lebih cepat, zoom in/out lebih halus, dan alat seleksi baru untuk mempersempit ke rentang hasil tertentu.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`qiskit-ibm-runtime` code snippets in job results** — copy-ready code to retrieve a job by ID; for Executor jobs, an additional snippet lets you replicate the job.  \n"
msgstr "**Cuplikan kode `qiskit-ibm-runtime` pada hasil job** — kode siap pakai untuk mengambil job berdasarkan ID; untuk job Executor, tersedia cuplikan tambahan yang memungkinkan Anda mereplikasi job tersebut.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom date range filter** added to the workloads table.  \n"
msgstr "**Filter rentang tanggal kustom** ditambahkan ke tabel workload.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clickable instance names and tags** in workload detail pages, linking to the related resource.  \n"
msgstr "**Nama instance dan tag yang dapat diklik** di halaman detail workload, yang tertaut ke resource terkait.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Navigate to your results on the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) page to see these improvements.  \n"
msgstr "    Kunjungi hasil Anda di halaman [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) untuk melihat peningkatan ini.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer: OpenQASM v3.0 support  \n"
msgstr "Composer: dukungan OpenQASM v3.0  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Composer now supports OpenQASM v3.0, adding:  \n"
msgstr "    Composer sekarang mendukung OpenQASM v3.0, menambahkan:  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Gate modifiers** — ctrl, inv, pow, etc.  \n"
msgstr "**Gate modifiers** — ctrl, inv, pow, dan lainnya.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Loops** — for and while  \n"
msgstr "**Loop** — for dan while  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Conditional logic** — if/else  \n"
msgstr "**Logika kondisional** — if/else  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Box annotations** — group and label sections of a circuit  \n"
msgstr "**Anotasi box** — mengelompokkan dan memberi label bagian-bagian circuit  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Also included: smoother rendering for large circuits, and a fix for PNG exports failing on large circuits.  \n"
msgstr "    Juga termasuk: rendering yang lebih halus untuk circuit besar, dan perbaikan untuk ekspor PNG yang gagal pada circuit besar.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Visit the [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) to explore this new update.\n"
msgstr "  Kunjungi [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) untuk menjelajahi pembaruan baru ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage limits  \n"
msgstr "Batas penggunaan instance  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium and Open Plan instances that hit their usage limit now display the exact date access resumes, based on the rolling usage window.  \n"
msgstr "Instance Premium dan Open Plan yang mencapai batas penggunaannya sekarang menampilkan tanggal pasti kapan akses dilanjutkan, berdasarkan jendela penggunaan bergulir.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  See more on your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.  \n"
msgstr "  Lihat lebih lanjut di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) Anda.  \n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "July 2026 {#july-2026}"
msgstr "Juli 2026 {#july-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qr-rename\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime rename {#qiskit-runtime-rename}"
msgstr "Perubahan nama Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-rename}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qiskit Runtime service is now IBM Quantum Compute Service** &mdash; This is a naming change only and does not require any code changes or updates to existing applications. You might notice the new name throughout the user interface and documentation.\n"
msgstr "**Layanan Qiskit Runtime kini menjadi IBM Quantum Compute Service** &mdash; Ini hanyalah perubahan nama dan tidak memerlukan perubahan kode atau pembaruan pada aplikasi yang sudah ada. Anda mungkin akan melihat nama baru ini di seluruh antarmuka pengguna dan dokumentasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Historically, the term _Qiskit Runtime_ was used to refer to three related but distinct concepts.\n"
msgstr "    Secara historis, istilah _Qiskit Runtime_ digunakan untuk merujuk pada tiga konsep yang berkaitan tetapi berbeda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Any hardware provider that wants Qiskit users to run workloads on its quantum computers must provide two provider-specific components:\n"
msgstr "    Penyedia perangkat keras mana pun yang ingin pengguna Qiskit menjalankan workload di komputer kuantumnya harus menyediakan dua komponen khusus penyedia:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Qiskit SDK extension, which enables users to submit jobs to the provider. In IBM's case, this is the open-source `qiskit-ibm-runtime` library. Rather than communicating directly with the quantum computer, it submits jobs to a cloud API.\n"
msgstr "Ekstensi Qiskit SDK, yang memungkinkan pengguna mengirimkan job ke penyedia. Dalam kasus IBM, ini adalah library open-source `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Alih-alih berkomunikasi langsung dengan komputer kuantum, library ini mengirimkan job ke API cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A runtime execution environment, which runs on the quantum computer itself. This component understands Qiskit primitives, translates them into hardware-specific operations, and executes them on the quantum hardware. In IBM's case, this is IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Lingkungan eksekusi runtime, yang berjalan di komputer kuantum itu sendiri. Komponen ini memahami primitif Qiskit, menerjemahkannya ke dalam operasi khusus perangkat keras, dan mengeksekusinya pada perangkat keras kuantum. Dalam kasus IBM, ini adalah IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Between these two components sits a third element: the managed cloud service that receives jobs from the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` SDK and orchestrates their execution. This service is responsible for capabilities such as authentication, scheduling, queue management, workload routing, usage tracking, limits, and analytics. It does not process Qiskit primitives itself; instead, it dispatches workloads to the appropriate quantum computer, where the runtime execution environment performs the actual execution.\n"
msgstr "    Di antara kedua komponen ini terdapat elemen ketiga: layanan cloud terkelola yang menerima job dari SDK `qiskit-ibm-runtime` dan mengatur eksekusinya. Layanan ini bertanggung jawab atas kemampuan seperti autentikasi, penjadwalan, manajemen antrean, perutean workload, pelacakan penggunaan, batasan, dan analitik. Layanan ini tidak memproses primitif Qiskit itu sendiri; sebaliknya, ia mengirimkan workload ke komputer kuantum yang sesuai, tempat lingkungan eksekusi runtime melakukan eksekusi sebenarnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Historically, this cloud service was also called Qiskit Runtime Service, even though it is conceptually different from the runtime itself. This dual use of the term Qiskit Runtime &mdash; to describe both the execution environment and the managed cloud service &mdash; blurred the architecture and made it difficult to distinguish the open-source components from the managed cloud offering.\n"
msgstr "    Secara historis, layanan cloud ini juga disebut Qiskit Runtime Service, meskipun secara konseptual berbeda dari runtime itu sendiri. Penggunaan ganda istilah Qiskit Runtime ini &mdash; untuk menggambarkan baik lingkungan eksekusi maupun layanan cloud terkelola &mdash; mengaburkan arsitektur dan menyulitkan untuk membedakan komponen open-source dari penawaran cloud terkelola.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Renaming Qiskit Runtime Service to IBM Quantum Compute Service resolves this ambiguity. The resulting architecture becomes much clearer:\n"
msgstr "    Mengganti nama Qiskit Runtime Service menjadi IBM Quantum Compute Service menyelesaikan ambiguitas ini. Arsitektur yang dihasilkan menjadi jauh lebih jelas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-runtime`: the open-source Qiskit extension that submits workloads.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-runtime`: ekstensi Qiskit open-source yang mengirimkan workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service: the managed cloud service that authenticates, schedules, manages, and routes workloads.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service: layanan cloud terkelola yang melakukan autentikasi, penjadwalan, pengelolaan, dan perutean workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Qiskit Runtime (or IBM Qiskit Runtime Execution Environment): the execution environment running on the quantum computer that processes and executes Qiskit primitives.\n"
msgstr "IBM Qiskit Runtime (atau IBM Qiskit Runtime Execution Environment): lingkungan eksekusi yang berjalan pada komputer kuantum yang memproses dan mengeksekusi primitif Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "May 2026 {#may-2026}"
msgstr "Mei 2026 {#may-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Store instruction {#store-instruction}"
msgstr "Instruksi Store {#store-instruction}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Support for the [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the Store instruction.\n"
msgstr "**Dukungan untuk instruksi [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) pada QPU IBM&reg;** - Sekarang Anda dapat menyederhanakan komputasi klasik yang kompleks dalam circuit kuantum Anda dengan instruksi Store.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute a classical expression mid-circuit and save the result to a variable or register, which can then immediately control subsequent quantum gates.  Instead of deeply nested inline expressions, you can break computations into named intermediate steps, so that complex classical feedback logic is easier to read and maintain. **Common use cases** include the following:\n"
msgstr "Hitung ekspresi klasik di tengah circuit dan simpan hasilnya ke variabel atau register, yang kemudian dapat langsung mengontrol gate kuantum berikutnya. Alih-alih ekspresi inline yang bertingkat dalam, Anda dapat memecah komputasi menjadi langkah-langkah antara yang diberi nama, sehingga logika umpan balik klasik yang kompleks lebih mudah dibaca dan dipelihara. **Kasus penggunaan umum** meliputi hal berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits with mid-circuit measurements and classical feedback  \n"
msgstr "Circuit dinamis dengan pengukuran di tengah circuit dan umpan balik klasik  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Long-range entanglement preparation  \n"
msgstr "Persiapan entanglement jarak jauh  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complex conditional logic based on measurement outcomes\n"
msgstr "Logika kondisional kompleks berdasarkan hasil pengukuran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    To use the store instruction, first ensure you're running the latest version of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-runtime`), then see the [documentation](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) for more information and an example.\n"
msgstr "    Untuk menggunakan instruksi store, pertama pastikan Anda menjalankan versi terbaru `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-runtime`), lalu lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) untuk info lebih lanjut dan contohnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    *Note that before submitting jobs, you should verify compatibility with each primitive's options in the documentation*: [Sampler options](/guides/sampler-options) | [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-options) | [Executor options](/guides/executor-options)\n"
msgstr "    *Perhatikan bahwa sebelum mengirimkan job, Anda harus memverifikasi kompatibilitas dengan opsi masing-masing primitif dalam dokumentasi*: [Opsi Sampler](/guides/sampler-options) | [Opsi Estimator](/guides/estimator-options) | [Opsi Executor](/guides/executor-options)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "April 2026 {#april-2026}"
msgstr "April 2026 {#april-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classroom accounts {#classroom-accounts}"
msgstr "Akun Classroom {#classroom-accounts}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New Classroom Accounts**: Professors can now request a [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts, students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal credit card information.\n"
msgstr "**Akun Classroom Baru**: Profesor sekarang dapat meminta [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) untuk mengelola dan memfasilitasi akses bagi mahasiswanya. Dengan Classroom Account, mahasiswa dapat menggunakan sumber daya Open Plan tanpa perlu memberikan informasi kartu kredit pribadi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New export options now available in IBM Quantum**: Introducing new export capabilities that make it easier for account administrators to analyze, share, and work with their data.\n"
msgstr "**Opsi ekspor baru kini tersedia di IBM Quantum**: Memperkenalkan kemampuan ekspor baru yang memudahkan administrator akun untuk menganalisis, membagikan, dan mengolah data mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page:\n"
msgstr "Baru di halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can now export charts in SVG or PNG format.\n"
msgstr "Anda sekarang dapat mengekspor chart dalam format SVG atau PNG.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can export all analytics data, including the data behind the charts, as CSV.\n"
msgstr "Anda dapat mengekspor semua data analitik, termasuk data di balik chart, sebagai CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of each card on the page.\n"
msgstr "      Temukan menu ekspor di pojok kanan atas setiap kartu di halaman.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) page:\n"
msgstr "Baru di halaman [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export both the Users table and the Access Groups table in CSV format.\n"
msgstr "Ekspor baik tabel Users maupun tabel Access Groups dalam format CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of the table.\n"
msgstr "      Temukan menu ekspor di pojok kanan atas tabel.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New resources and hardware for Open Plan users**: The [IBM Quantum Open Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) now features new learning resources, new hardware, and a special one-time promotion for eligible users.\n"
msgstr "**Sumber daya dan perangkat keras baru untuk pengguna Open Plan**: [IBM Quantum Open Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) sekarang menghadirkan sumber belajar baru, perangkat keras baru, dan promosi satu kali khusus untuk pengguna yang memenuhi syarat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new course, [Designing and leading quantum projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), is now available. This course covers key topics for users looking to develop or secure funding for a quantum project, including early-stage planning, team roles and responsibilities, identifying meaningful use cases, defining measures of success, and a guide to grant writing best practices.\n"
msgstr "Kursus baru, [Designing and leading quantum projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), kini tersedia. Kursus ini mencakup topik-topik penting bagi pengguna yang ingin mengembangkan atau mendapatkan pendanaan untuk proyek kuantum, termasuk perencanaan tahap awal, peran dan tanggung jawab tim, mengidentifikasi use case yang bermakna, mendefinisikan ukuran keberhasilan, dan panduan praktik terbaik penulisan proposal hibah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Heron r2 [`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;one of our highest-performing quantum computers&mdash;is now available to all Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Heron r2 [`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;salah satu komputer kuantum berkinerja terbaik kami&mdash;sekarang tersedia untuk semua pengguna Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log 20 minutes of compute in any 12-month period and you can opt in to a special one-time offer: 180 minutes for the next 12 months.\n"
msgstr "Catat 20 menit komputasi dalam periode 12 bulan mana pun dan Anda dapat memilih penawaran satu kali khusus: 180 menit untuk 12 bulan berikutnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      With expanded runtime and new educational resources, users can run everything from introductory circuits to advanced hybrid workflows.\n"
msgstr "      Dengan runtime yang diperluas dan sumber belajar baru, pengguna dapat menjalankan segalanya mulai dari circuit pengantar hingga alur kerja hybrid tingkat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      These efforts reflect our commitment to open access, open education, and open science in quantum computing. Read more: [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"
msgstr "      Upaya ini mencerminkan komitmen kami terhadap akses terbuka, pendidikan terbuka, dan ilmu terbuka dalam komputasi kuantum. Baca selengkapnya: [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Upcoming discontinuation of Qiskit Code Assistant service\n"
msgstr "  ### Penghentian layanan Qiskit Code Assistant yang akan datang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  On 29 May 2026, IBM Quantum will discontinue the preview Qiskit Code Assistant service and archive the supporting extensions for Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab.\n"
msgstr "  Pada 29 Mei 2026, IBM Quantum akan menghentikan layanan pratinjau Qiskit Code Assistant dan mengarsipkan ekstensi pendukung untuk Visual Studio Code dan JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr "  Berdasarkan umpan balik dan pola penggunaan, semakin banyak pengguna yang menjalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant secara lokal dan bekerja dengan integrasi editor yang sudah menjadi bagian dari alur kerja pengembangan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Qiskit Code Assistant models will remain available for local use. To continue using them, move to a local deployment and a community-supported editor integration or other local tooling.\n"
msgstr "  Model Qiskit Code Assistant akan tetap tersedia untuk penggunaan lokal. Untuk terus menggunakannya, pindah ke deployment lokal dan integrasi editor yang didukung komunitas atau tooling lokal lainnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  For setup guidance, see the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) guide.\n"
msgstr "  Untuk panduan penyiapan, lihat panduan [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Nighthawk arrives in the EU\n"
msgstr "  ### Nighthawk tiba di UE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! It is the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 QPU in the EU (`eu-de` region) and the second Nighthawk in our global fleet, after [`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) in the US (`us-east` region). `ibm_berlin` features faster two-qubit gates than `ibm_miami` (68 ns versus 138 ns, median) while maintaining similar fleet-leading coherence (T$_1$ of ~350 &#181;s).\n"
msgstr "  Premium dan Flex Plan sekarang memiliki akses awal ke [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! Ini adalah QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 pertama di UE (kawasan `eu-de`) dan Nighthawk kedua dalam armada global kami, setelah [`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) di AS (kawasan `us-east`). `ibm_berlin` menampilkan gate dua-qubit yang lebih cepat dibandingkan `ibm_miami` (68 ns berbanding 138 ns, median) sambil mempertahankan koherensi yang serupa dan terdepan di armada (T$_1$ ~350 &#181;s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Since its release, Nighthawk has enabled research in regimes where classical simulation becomes increasingly challenging. Specifically, its architecture supports hardware-efficient workflows that map naturally onto grid-based (lattice) models. See recent papers from [Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) and [Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), and their collaborators, demonstrating simulation at scale on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr "  Sejak dirilis, Nighthawk telah memungkinkan penelitian pada rezim di mana simulasi klasik menjadi semakin menantang. Secara khusus, arsitekturnya mendukung alur kerja yang efisien perangkat keras dan secara alami dipetakan ke model berbasis grid (lattice). Lihat makalah terbaru dari [Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) dan [Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), beserta kolaboratornya, yang mendemonstrasikan simulasi berskala besar pada Nighthawk.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Please note that `ibm_berlin` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr "  Harap dicatat bahwa `ibm_berlin` saat ini merupakan QPU eksploratori yang masih diuji dan dioptimalkan sebagai bagian dari siklus pembelajaran berkelanjutan kami. Oleh karena itu, untuk sementara memiliki keterbatasan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4 ms, which impacts QPU time required to execute workloads. Users can manually select a shorter repetition time, but performance might be degraded.\n"
msgstr "Waktu repetisi default untuk sementara ditingkatkan dari 250 &#181;s menjadi 4 ms, yang memengaruhi waktu QPU yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan workload. Pengguna dapat memilih waktu repetisi yang lebih pendek secara manual, tetapi performa mungkin menurun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit measurements is limited.\n"
msgstr "Circuit dinamis belum didukung, dan kualitas pengukuran di tengah circuit masih terbatas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Upcoming retirements\n"
msgstr "  ### Pensiun yang akan datang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  As we expand EU capacity and roll out the latest Nighthawk and Heron processors, `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` are scheduled to be retired on or around 30 April 2026.\n"
msgstr "  Seiring kami memperluas kapasitas UE dan meluncurkan prosesor Nighthawk dan Heron terbaru, `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` dijadwalkan untuk dipensiunkan pada atau sekitar 30 April 2026.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Once these QPUs are retired, they will no longer accept jobs. If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to another active QPU ahead of the retirement date to take advantage of the latest systems. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Setelah QPU ini dipensiunkan, mereka tidak akan lagi menerima job. Jika alur kerja Anda menargetkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, silakan bermigrasi ke QPU aktif lainnya sebelum tanggal pensiun untuk memanfaatkan sistem terbaru. Untuk panduan mengambil data dari job sebelumnya, lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### `ibm_torino` is now retired\n"
msgstr "  ### `ibm_torino` sekarang telah dipensiunkan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The quantum computer `ibm_torino` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on this QPU might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "  Komputer kuantum `ibm_torino` telah dipensiunkan dan tidak akan lagi menerima pengiriman workload. Workload apa pun yang sudah diantrekan pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this QPU, refer to [these instructions](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika Anda ingin mengambil data job dari workload penting yang dijalankan pada QPU ini, lihat [petunjuk berikut](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### ibm_brussels and ibm_strasbourg are now retired\n"
msgstr "  ### ibm_brussels dan ibm_strasbourg sekarang telah dipensiunkan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` have been retired and will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr "  `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` telah dipensiunkan dan tidak akan lagi menerima job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  This change is part of the continued evolution and expansion of the IBM Quantum fleet in the EU, including the recently released Nighthawk QPU [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) and the upgraded Heron r3 QPU [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). The global fleet has now fully transitioned away from Eagle, IBM Quantum's first utility‑scale processor family, introduced in 2021.\n"
msgstr "  Perubahan ini merupakan bagian dari evolusi dan ekspansi berkelanjutan armada IBM Quantum di UE, termasuk QPU Nighthawk [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) yang baru dirilis dan QPU Heron r3 [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) yang telah ditingkatkan. Armada global kini telah sepenuhnya beralih dari Eagle, keluarga prosesor skala-utilitas pertama IBM Quantum, yang diperkenalkan pada 2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to another active QPU to take advantage of the latest hardware. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika alur kerja Anda menargetkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, silakan bermigrasi ke QPU aktif lainnya untuk memanfaatkan perangkat keras terbaru. Untuk panduan mengambil data dari job sebelumnya, lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "March 2026 {#march-2026}"
msgstr "Maret 2026 {#march-2026}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The EU gets its first Heron r3 {#the-eu-gets-its-first-heron-r3}"
msgstr "UE mendapatkan Heron r3 pertamanya {#the-eu-gets-its-first-heron-r3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Maintenance has been completed on [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) and the QPU is now back online in the eu‑de region.  `ibm_aachen` has also been upgraded to be the first QPU in the EU to feature the latest [Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) processor. It is the third r3 in our global fleet, after [`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) and [`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) in the US.\n"
msgstr "  Pemeliharaan telah selesai dilakukan pada [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) dan QPU tersebut kini kembali online di kawasan eu-de. `ibm_aachen` juga telah ditingkatkan menjadi QPU pertama di UE yang dilengkapi prosesor [Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) terbaru. Ini adalah r3 ketiga dalam armada global kami, setelah [`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) dan [`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) di AS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Heron r3 continues to deliver improved error rates and overall system performance compared to Heron r2, demonstrating more reliable execution and better results for workloads. For example, on `ibm_aachen`, we observe a large boost in $T_2$ (phase coherence time) from 150&nbsp;&#181;s to 250&nbsp;&#181;s. You can view metrics like these for all QPUs in the shared fleet on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
msgstr "  Heron r3 terus memberikan tingkat kesalahan dan performa sistem secara keseluruhan yang lebih baik dibandingkan Heron r2, menunjukkan eksekusi yang lebih andal dan hasil yang lebih baik untuk workload. Misalnya, pada `ibm_aachen`, kami mengamati peningkatan besar pada $T_2$ (waktu koherensi fase) dari 150&nbsp;&#181;s menjadi 250&nbsp;&#181;s. Anda dapat melihat metrik seperti ini untuk semua QPU dalam armada bersama di halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "February 2026 {#february-2026}"
msgstr "Februari 2026 {#february-2026}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"
msgstr "  ### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The `ibm_torino` QPU will retire on or around 1 April 2026. Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr "  QPU `ibm_torino` akan dipensiunkan pada atau sekitar 1 April 2026. Setelah QPU ini dipensiunkan, ia tidak akan lagi menerima job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If you would like to retrieve job data from important past jobs, please refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika Anda ingin mengambil data job dari job penting sebelumnya, silakan lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Increase in repetition delay time maximum\n"
msgstr "  ### Peningkatan maksimum waktu penundaan repetisi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To provide more flexibility for users, we have expanded the allowable repetition delay time range from 20-500 &#181;s to 20-2000 &#181;s on our Heron and Eagle QPUs. The Nighthawk QPU delay time range continues to be 1000-4000 &#181;s as previously announced. Note that if you choose to increase repetition delay (`rep_delay`), it will have a direct impact on your execution time and capacity consumption, but it might improve the fidelity of certain circuits. The default `rep_delay` remains unchanged on all QPUs.\n"
msgstr "  Untuk memberikan lebih banyak fleksibilitas bagi pengguna, kami telah memperluas rentang waktu penundaan repetisi yang diizinkan dari 20-500 &#181;s menjadi 20-2000 &#181;s pada QPU Heron dan Eagle kami. Rentang waktu penundaan QPU Nighthawk tetap 1000-4000 &#181;s seperti yang telah diumumkan sebelumnya. Perhatikan bahwa jika Anda memilih untuk meningkatkan penundaan repetisi (`rep_delay`), hal ini akan berdampak langsung pada waktu eksekusi dan konsumsi kapasitas Anda, tetapi dapat meningkatkan fidelitas circuit tertentu. `rep_delay` default tetap tidak berubah pada semua QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can find more information about repetition delay time, including how to change it, in [Qubit initialization](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"
msgstr "  Anda dapat menemukan informasi lebih lanjut tentang waktu penundaan repetisi, termasuk cara mengubahnya, di [Qubit initialization](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The latest enhancements to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page include the following:\n"
msgstr "Peningkatan terbaru pada halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) mencakup hal berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet across the two regions. (You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel icon.)\n"
msgstr "**Tampilan QPU terpadu** - Semua QPU di berbagai kawasan sekarang ditampilkan dalam satu tabel, sehingga lebih mudah melihat status dan kalibrasi armada bersama di kedua kawasan. (Anda masih dapat memfilter tabel Compute resources berdasarkan kawasan menggunakan ikon corong.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Single maintenance schedule** - The maintenance schedule is now at the top of the page, even when no events are currently planned.\n"
msgstr "**Jadwal pemeliharaan tunggal** - Jadwal pemeliharaan sekarang berada di bagian atas halaman, bahkan ketika tidak ada acara yang sedang direncanakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**\"Instance access\" details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new Instance access section shows all instances that grant the user access to that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr "**Detail \"Instance access\"** - Saat melihat detail QPU, bagian Instance access baru menampilkan semua instance yang memberikan akses pengguna ke QPU tersebut untuk akun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The first Nighthawk QPU and latest Heron QPU are now available.** These two powerful new processors debuted at the [IBM Quantum Developer Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) in November.\n"
msgstr "**QPU Nighthawk pertama dan QPU Heron terbaru kini tersedia.** Kedua prosesor baru yang kuat ini debut di [IBM Quantum Developer Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) pada November.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to `ibm_miami`, the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk QPU. Our most advanced quantum processor to date, Nighthawk is a 120-qubit device with a square-lattice topology (218 couplers versus Heron's 176) that is designed to support more complex workloads. Nighthawk has the highest coherence of our fleet - even higher than what was reported at QDC - with a median T1 of 350 &#181;s.\n"
msgstr "Premium dan Flex Plan sekarang memiliki akses awal ke `ibm_miami`, QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk pertama. Prosesor kuantum paling canggih kami hingga saat ini, Nighthawk adalah perangkat 120-qubit dengan topologi kisi persegi (218 coupler dibandingkan 176 milik Heron) yang dirancang untuk mendukung workload yang lebih kompleks. Nighthawk memiliki koherensi tertinggi dalam armada kami - bahkan lebih tinggi dari yang dilaporkan di QDC - dengan median T1 sebesar 350 &#181;s.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that `ibm_miami` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa `ibm_miami` saat ini merupakan QPU eksploratori yang masih diuji dan dioptimalkan sebagai bagian dari siklus pembelajaran berkelanjutan kami. Oleh karena itu, untuk sementara memiliki keterbatasan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4 ms, which will impact QPU time required to execute workloads\n"
msgstr "Waktu repetisi default untuk sementara ditingkatkan dari 250 &#181;s menjadi 4 ms, yang akan memengaruhi waktu QPU yang diperlukan untuk menjalankan workload\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit measurements is limited\n"
msgstr "Circuit dinamis belum didukung, dan kualitas pengukuran di tengah circuit masih terbatas\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to `ibm_boston`, our most performant IBM Quantum Heron r3 to date. It has demonstrated an EPLG at 100 qubits of 2.15e-3, with 57 of 176 possible two-qubit gates below the 1e-3 error level.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, Premium, Flex, dan Pay-As-You-Go Plan sekarang memiliki akses ke `ibm_boston`, IBM Quantum Heron r3 kami yang paling berperforma hingga saat ini. QPU ini telah menunjukkan EPLG pada 100 qubit sebesar 2.15e-3, dengan 57 dari 176 kemungkinan gate dua-qubit berada di bawah level kesalahan 1e-3.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Introducing instance archiving for administrators on IBM Quantum Platform.** With this update, administrators can archive any instance within their account. Archiving an instance ensures that:\n"
msgstr "**Memperkenalkan pengarsipan instance untuk administrator di IBM Quantum Platform.** Dengan pembaruan ini, administrator dapat mengarsipkan instance apa pun dalam akun mereka. Mengarsipkan instance memastikan bahwa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collaborators retain access to results and QPU metrics, properties, and calibrations from past workloads.\n"
msgstr "Kolaborator tetap memiliki akses ke hasil dan metrik, properti, serta kalibrasi QPU dari workload sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "No new workloads can be submitted to the archived instance, preventing unintended usage.\n"
msgstr "Tidak ada workload baru yang dapat dikirimkan ke instance yang diarsipkan, mencegah penggunaan yang tidak diinginkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances do not subtract anything from your account's plan allocation.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang diarsipkan tidak mengurangi apa pun dari alokasi plan akun Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All archived instances are neatly organized under a dedicated \"Archived\" tab.\n"
msgstr "Semua instance yang diarsipkan diorganisasikan dengan rapi di bawah tab \"Archived\" khusus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrators can reactivate an instance at any time.\n"
msgstr "Administrator dapat mengaktifkan kembali instance kapan saja.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) This new execution model allows you to fine-tune error mitigation and other techniques without sacrificing performance by providing the ingredients to capture design intents on the client side, and shifting the costly generation of circuit variants to the server side. For example, you can use the [Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) to define the exact layers in your circuits to apply Pauli-twirling and to inject noise. The new [Executor primitive](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) will then follow your directives to generate and execute the randomized circuit variants in Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) Model eksekusi baru ini memungkinkan Anda menyempurnakan mitigasi kesalahan dan teknik lainnya tanpa mengorbankan performa, dengan menyediakan komponen untuk menangkap maksud desain di sisi klien, dan memindahkan pembuatan varian circuit yang mahal ke sisi server. Misalnya, Anda dapat menggunakan [Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) untuk mendefinisikan lapisan-lapisan tepat dalam circuit Anda tempat menerapkan Pauli-twirling dan menyuntikkan noise. [Executor primitive](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) yang baru kemudian akan mengikuti arahan Anda untuk menghasilkan dan mengeksekusi varian circuit yang diacak dalam Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Pembaruan sebelumnya {#previous-updates}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2025 {#2025}"
msgstr "2025 {#2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Fourth quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal keempat\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update is now live!\n"
msgstr "Pembaruan kuartalan [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) kini telah tayang!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This convenient wrap-up aims to get you started exploring the latest hardware, software, research, and community events from IBM Quantum and our partner ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "Rangkuman praktis ini bertujuan membantu Anda memulai menjelajahi perangkat keras, perangkat lunak, penelitian, dan acara komunitas terbaru dari IBM Quantum dan ekosistem mitra kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlights include the recently deployed IBM Quantum Nighthawk and IBM Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, a call for submissions to the new open-source Quantum Advantage Tracker, and Qiskit C++, a new project designed to help HPC developers build production-grade quantum-centric supercomputing workflows.\n"
msgstr "Sorotan termasuk QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk dan IBM Quantum Heron r3 yang baru saja diluncurkan, ajakan untuk mengirimkan kontribusi ke Quantum Advantage Tracker open-source yang baru, dan Qiskit C++, proyek baru yang dirancang untuk membantu pengembang HPC membangun alur kerja komputasi super berpusat-kuantum tingkat produksi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This quarterly update also spotlights notable benchmarks, including:\n"
msgstr "Pembaruan kuartalan ini juga menyoroti benchmark penting, termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best EPLG: 0.23% on `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"
msgstr "EPLG terbaik: 0.23% pada `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best CLOPS: 330K+ across 7 QPUs\n"
msgstr "CLOPS terbaik: 330K+ di 7 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total available qubits: 2,477 across 17 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Total qubit yang tersedia: 2,477 di 17 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"
msgstr "Total makalah yang menggunakan IBM Quantum atau Qiskit: 5,635\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Discover these updates and more](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"
msgstr "[Temukan pembaruan ini dan lainnya](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute resources page update – Unified QPU view across regions {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"
msgstr "Pembaruan halaman Compute resources – Tampilan QPU terpadu di berbagai kawasan {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We’ve enhanced the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! New features include the following:\n"
msgstr "Kami telah meningkatkan halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers)! Fitur baru meliputi hal berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet across the two regions.\n"
msgstr "**Tampilan QPU terpadu** - Semua QPU di seluruh region kini ditampilkan dalam satu tabel, sehingga lebih mudah melihat status dan kalibrasi armada bersama di kedua region.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clearer \"Instance Access\" Details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new Instance access section shows all instances that grant you access to that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr "**Detail \"Instance Access\" yang lebih jelas** - Saat melihat detail QPU, bagian Instance access baru menampilkan semua instance yang memberi Anda akses ke QPU tersebut untuk akun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel icon at the top of the table.\n"
msgstr "Anda masih dapat memfilter tabel Compute resources berdasarkan region menggunakan ikon corong di bagian atas tabel.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"
msgstr "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quantum computer `ibm_brisbane` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "Komputer kuantum `ibm_brisbane` telah dipensiunkan dan tidak akan lagi menerima pengiriman workload. Workload yang sudah masuk antrean di QPU ini mungkin masih akan diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this QPU, refer to [these instructions](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin mengambil data job dari workload penting yang dijalankan di QPU ini, lihat [instruksi berikut](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr "Oktober 2025 {#october-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr "Armada IBM Quantum menyambut `ibm_fez` dan `ibm_marrakesh` ke Open Plan! Semua pengguna dapat mengakses komputer ini mulai 27 Oktober.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai pengingat, `ibm_brisbane` akan dipensiunkan pada 3 Nov 2025, jadi rencanakan eksperimen Anda sesuai dengan itu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce that translations are now available across all documentation and learning pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr "**Pelajari komputasi kuantum dalam bahasa Anda sendiri**: Kami dengan senang hati mengumumkan bahwa terjemahan kini tersedia di semua halaman dokumentasi dan pembelajaran di IBM Quantum Platform! Terjemahan merupakan fitur yang paling banyak diminta dalam masukan pengguna, dan kini, pembelajaran serta pengembangan kuantum menjadi lebih mudah diakses dari sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr "Terjemahan untuk **tutorial, kursus, dokumentasi, dan pengumuman** kini tersedia dalam tujuh bahasa: Prancis, Jerman, Italia, Jepang, Korea, Portugis, dan Spanyol.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your preferred language.\n"
msgstr "**Pencarian multibahasa**: Gunakan bilah pencarian untuk menemukan apa yang Anda butuhkan dalam bahasa pilihan Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr "**Sumber daya yang dapat diunduh**: Unduh sumber daya seperti panduan atau tutorial dalam bahasa yang paling sesuai untuk Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current versions only).\n"
msgstr "**Referensi API yang dilokalkan**: Jelajahi versi terbaru referensi API dan REST API dengan dokumentasi yang diterjemahkan sepenuhnya (hanya versi terkini).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr "**Pesan error & solusi**: Pahami masalah lebih cepat dengan kode error dan saran solusi yang diterjemahkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr "  Menemukan kesalahan terjemahan? Beri tahu kami! [Ajukan masalah terjemahan](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) di repo GitHub kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of recently released content for a few days while the translation is underway.*\n"
msgstr "  *Perhatikan bahwa ada jeda pemrosesan antara publikasi konten baru dan terjemahannya, jadi Anda mungkin hanya melihat versi bahasa Inggris dari konten yang baru dirilis selama beberapa hari sementara terjemahan sedang berlangsung.*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr "**Learning di IBM Quantum Platform** kini memiliki halaman beranda yang diperbarui untuk membantu Anda menavigasi sumber daya pendidikan yang tersedia, serta dua halaman katalog baru untuk membantu menelusuri kursus dan modul. [Lihat pembaruannya!](/learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
"- The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr "  Dengan versi baru ini, Anda dapat menjalankan sirkuit dinamis pada skala utilitas. Rilis awal ini menawarkan fitur-fitur berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr "Percepatan eksekusi 75x, berkat stack eksekusi kuantum terbaru\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Eksekusi cabang paralel, yang mengurangi durasi sirkuit dan meningkatkan kualitas hasil\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for [classical operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr "Dukungan untuk [operasi klasik](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) yang didefinisikan di Qiskit, kecuali untuk bit shift dan operasi aritmetika\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr "Dukungan untuk durasi stretch dalam instruksi delay. Tipe baru ini memungkinkan intent desain ditangkap pada saat konstruksi sirkuit, dan resolusi waktu pada saat kompilasi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr "  Fitur tambahan akan diluncurkan bertahap nanti pada tahun ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third Quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  Lihat [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) dan [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) untuk informasi lebih lanjut dan contoh kode.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal Ketiga\">\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"
msgstr "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
msgstr "[Survei Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) membantu menangkap kebutuhan dan kekhawatiran siapa pun yang bekerja dengan perangkat lunak kuantum - termasuk Anda! Hasil survei memberikan masukan berharga bagi tim developer Qiskit kami, dan membantu kami memahami lanskap perangkat lunak kuantum yang lebih luas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a few minutes, please share the link or consider filling it out today! The survey is open through 3 October 2025.\n"
msgstr "Jika Anda punya beberapa menit waktu luang, silakan bagikan tautannya atau pertimbangkan untuk mengisinya hari ini! Survei ini dibuka hingga 3 Oktober 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"
msgstr "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"
msgstr "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We plan to retire `ibm_brisbane` on or around 1 November 2025.\n"
msgstr "Kami berencana untuk mempensiunkan `ibm_brisbane` pada atau sekitar 1 November 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs. If any jobs are queued on the QPU at the time of its retirement, they will still run and return results. Please plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Setelah QPU ini dipensiunkan, QPU ini tidak akan lagi menerima job. Jika ada job yang mengantre di QPU pada saat pemensiunan, job tersebut akan tetap berjalan dan mengembalikan hasil. Mohon rencanakan eksperimen Anda sesuai dengan itu.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "31 July 2025 {#31-july-2025}"
msgstr "31 Juli 2025 {#31-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are thrilled to announce the launch of ibm_pittsburgh, our first quantum computer powered by the new Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, and located in our Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. r3 is the result of targeted improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr "Hari ini, kami dengan bangga mengumumkan peluncuran ibm_pittsburgh, komputer kuantum pertama kami yang ditenagai oleh QPU Heron Revision 3 (r3) baru, dan berlokasi di pusat data kuantum kami di Poughkeepsie. r3 merupakan hasil dari peningkatan yang ditargetkan yang secara langsung memengaruhi coherence, fidelitas gate, dan performa readout.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The results speak for themselves, including an industry-leading ~350 us of T2 coherence; see the [latest metrics on Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) on IBM Quantum Platform. This steady, measured progress is at the center of our strategy for delivering reliable and performant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya berbicara sendiri, termasuk coherence T2 terkemuka di industri sekitar ~350 us; lihat [metrik terbaru pada Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) di IBM Quantum Platform. Kemajuan yang stabil dan terukur ini merupakan inti dari strategi kami untuk menghadirkan komputasi kuantum yang andal dan berperforma tinggi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As recently announced, today we retire one of our Eagle processors, ibm_sherbrooke. We invite you to migrate to our quantum computers powered by Heron processors, to take advantage of the lower error rates (approximately 5x lower EPLG) and faster gates (nearly 8x faster), leading to more performant circuits.\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang baru-baru ini diumumkan, hari ini kami mempensiunkan salah satu prosesor Eagle kami, ibm_sherbrooke. Kami mengundang Anda untuk bermigrasi ke komputer kuantum kami yang ditenagai oleh prosesor Heron, untuk memanfaatkan tingkat error yang lebih rendah (sekitar 5x lebih rendah EPLG) dan gate yang lebih cepat (hampir 8x lebih cepat), yang menghasilkan sirkuit yang lebih berperforma.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Together, let’s open the door to more complex algorithmic exploration and real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Bersama-sama, mari kita buka pintu untuk eksplorasi algoritmik yang lebih kompleks dan aplikasi dunia nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 July 2025 {#24-july-2025}"
msgstr "24 Juli 2025 {#24-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum technology is advancing rapidly, and it can be challenging to keep up. To help you stay in the loop, we’ve put together a roundup featuring the newest tools, performance improvements, and updates from IBM Quantum. It includes links to code examples, documentation, and research to help you get the most out of our latest developments.\n"
msgstr "Teknologi kuantum berkembang pesat, dan bisa jadi menantang untuk terus mengikutinya. Untuk membantu Anda tetap mengikuti perkembangan, kami telah menyusun rangkuman yang menampilkan alat terbaru, peningkatan performa, dan pembaruan dari IBM Quantum. Rangkuman ini mencakup tautan ke contoh kode, dokumentasi, dan riset untuk membantu Anda memaksimalkan pengembangan terbaru kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn what's new at IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"
msgstr "[Pelajari apa yang baru di IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 June 2025 {#27-june-2025}"
msgstr "27 Juni 2025 {#27-june-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_sherbrooke` will now retire on or around 28 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "`ibm_sherbrooke` kini akan dipensiunkan pada atau sekitar 28 Juli 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before it is retired.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan untuk mengambil data job dari job penting sebelumnya sebelum dipensiunkan.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal Kedua\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 June 2025 {#24-june-2025}"
msgstr "24 Juni 2025 {#24-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Profile page: Now you can find integrated profile details directly in the new platform. Find your profile by clicking on the user icon in the top right or visiting your [profile page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"
msgstr "Halaman profil: Sekarang Anda dapat menemukan detail profil terintegrasi langsung di platform baru. Temukan profil Anda dengan mengklik ikon pengguna di kanan atas atau kunjungi [halaman profil](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile) Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public backends: View a list of US backends without logging in, available on the updated [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
msgstr "Backend publik: Lihat daftar backend AS tanpa perlu login, tersedia di halaman [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) yang telah diperbarui.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learning: Quantum computing courses have now been released in the upgraded platform, along with new educational modules designed to help teachers bring Qiskit into their classrooms. This is the first step towards migrating IBM Quantum Learning to the new platform, with more resources to be released in the coming weeks. Resources can be accessed without needing to log in at [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Check out new and updated content, including [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), and Qiskit in Classrooms modules like [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) and [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"
msgstr "Learning: Kursus komputasi kuantum kini telah dirilis di platform yang ditingkatkan, bersama dengan modul pendidikan baru yang dirancang untuk membantu para guru membawa Qiskit ke dalam kelas mereka. Ini adalah langkah pertama menuju migrasi IBM Quantum Learning ke platform baru, dengan lebih banyak sumber daya yang akan dirilis dalam beberapa minggu mendatang. Sumber daya dapat diakses tanpa perlu login di [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Lihat konten baru dan yang diperbarui, termasuk [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), dan modul Qiskit in Classrooms seperti [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) dan [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Composer: The circuit-building [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) has now been migrated to the new platform. The experience is largely the same, except for files will no longer be stored in the platform, and will need to be downloaded locally. Find more details in the [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Composer: [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) untuk membangun sirkuit kini telah dimigrasikan ke platform baru. Pengalamannya sebagian besar sama, kecuali bahwa file tidak akan lagi disimpan di platform, dan perlu diunduh secara lokal. Temukan lebih banyak detail di [dokumentasi Composer](/guides/composer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Announcements: Now you can access news, software updates, and service alerts on the new platform. Click the bell icon in the top navigation bar or the link under Featured resources on the [home page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) to visit the new Announcements page.\n"
msgstr "Pengumuman: Sekarang Anda dapat mengakses berita, pembaruan perangkat lunak, dan peringatan layanan di platform baru. Klik ikon lonceng di bilah navigasi atas atau tautan di bawah Featured resources pada [halaman beranda](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) untuk mengunjungi halaman Announcements yang baru.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Juni 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Added instance job filter: The platform now displays only your workloads by default. On the dashboard, you will see only the latest workloads you have submitted to instances within your account.\n"
msgstr "Menambahkan filter job instance: Platform kini secara default hanya menampilkan workload Anda. Pada dashboard, Anda hanya akan melihat workload terbaru yang telah Anda kirimkan ke instance dalam akun Anda.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new qiskit-ibm-runtime release, featuring:\n"
msgstr "Rilis qiskit-ibm-runtime baru, yang menampilkan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for private jobs for developers of Qiskit Functions\n"
msgstr "Dukungan untuk private job bagi para developer Qiskit Functions\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new channel for the platform that makes instance selection optional, which simplifies account setup and backend access by automatically checking all available instances. This update benefits users who manage multiple instances or prefer a streamlined workflow without specifying instance details each time. Developers and researchers working across various projects with different levels of access and multiple backends will find this especially helpful.\n"
msgstr "Channel baru untuk platform yang membuat pemilihan instance menjadi opsional, yang menyederhanakan pengaturan akun dan akses backend dengan secara otomatis memeriksa semua instance yang tersedia. Pembaruan ini bermanfaat bagi pengguna yang mengelola beberapa instance atau lebih suka alur kerja yang efisien tanpa perlu menentukan detail instance setiap kali. Developer dan peneliti yang bekerja di berbagai proyek dengan tingkat akses berbeda dan beberapa backend akan merasa ini sangat membantu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now available: Early access to the new version of dynamic circuits on select QPUs. This new version will allow you to run dynamic circuits at utility scale and comes with improvements in speed, quality, and usability. Premium Plan and Flex Plan users interested in participating in this early access can [contact us](/guides/support).\n"
msgstr "Kini tersedia: Akses awal ke versi baru sirkuit dinamis pada QPU tertentu. Versi baru ini akan memungkinkan Anda menjalankan sirkuit dinamis pada skala utilitas dan hadir dengan peningkatan dalam kecepatan, kualitas, dan kegunaan. Pengguna Premium Plan dan Flex Plan yang tertarik untuk berpartisipasi dalam akses awal ini dapat [menghubungi kami](/guides/support).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 May 2025 {#15-may-2025}"
msgstr "15 Mei 2025 {#15-may-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Note: This is relevant to IBM Quantum Platform Classic (at https://quantum.ibm.com/) only.*\n"
msgstr "*Catatan: Ini hanya relevan untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic (di https://quantum.ibm.com/).*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are still using [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) at https://quantum.ibm.com, please note that it will no longer be accessible starting 1 July 2025. At that time, Open Plan access will only be available on the [new Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and you will no longer have access to this platform or its data. Download your data and migrate to the new platform as soon as possible to avoid interruptions in your work. See the migration guide for more details.\n"
msgstr "Jika Anda masih menggunakan [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) di https://quantum.ibm.com, mohon perhatikan bahwa platform ini tidak akan lagi dapat diakses mulai 1 Juli 2025. Pada saat itu, akses Open Plan hanya akan tersedia di [Platform baru](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan Anda tidak akan lagi memiliki akses ke platform ini atau datanya. Unduh data Anda dan bermigrasilah ke platform baru sesegera mungkin untuk menghindari gangguan dalam pekerjaan Anda. Lihat panduan migrasi untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users of other plans (for example, Premium Plan or On-Prem Plan) should wait for specific instructions from their administrators before migrating.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna paket lain (misalnya, Premium Plan atau On-Prem Plan) sebaiknya menunggu instruksi khusus dari administrator mereka sebelum bermigrasi.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "8 May 2025 {#8-may-2025}"
msgstr "8 Mei 2025 {#8-may-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), a new resource consumption offering, has been released.\n"
msgstr "[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), penawaran konsumsi sumber daya baru, telah dirilis.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) are now available on the platform to help users with use-case exploration.\n"
msgstr "[Tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) kini tersedia di platform untuk membantu pengguna dalam eksplorasi use case.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) has launched on the platform.\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) telah diluncurkan di platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated Session OpenAPI schema: `backend_name` field is now nullable.\n"
msgstr "Skema Session OpenAPI yang diperbarui: field `backend_name` kini dapat bernilai null.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"
msgstr "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance limits: Individuals can view [available time and usage](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), which displays alerts when approaching limits.\n"
msgstr "Batas instance: Individu dapat melihat [waktu dan penggunaan yang tersedia](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), yang menampilkan peringatan saat mendekati batas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator permissions: Administrators can view overall usage, cycle period, and remaining time per plan in the Instances page.\n"
msgstr "Izin administrator: Administrator dapat melihat total penggunaan, periode siklus, dan waktu tersisa per paket di halaman Instances.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search: Search is now integrated and available for filtering documentation content, including guides and API references.\n"
msgstr "Pencarian: Pencarian kini terintegrasi dan tersedia untuk memfilter konten dokumentasi, termasuk panduan dan referensi API.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing: Pay-As-You-Go users can find a link to billing by clicking the overflow menu for each instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr "Penagihan: Pengguna Pay-As-You-Go dapat menemukan tautan ke penagihan dengan mengklik menu overflow untuk setiap instance di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New sign-in option: Sign-in with Google is now available on the [sign-in page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"
msgstr "Opsi masuk baru: Masuk dengan Google kini tersedia di [halaman masuk](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bug fixes:\n"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed failed batch sessions for Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Mengatasi batch session yang gagal untuk pengguna Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed batch sessions not closing properly.\n"
msgstr "Mengatasi batch session yang tidak tertutup dengan benar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improved platform stability by improving error handling and better recovery.\n"
msgstr "Meningkatkan stabilitas platform dengan meningkatkan penanganan error dan pemulihan yang lebih baik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed an issue that prevented QPU metrics to be displayed for the QPUs in the eu-de region.\n"
msgstr "Mengatasi masalah yang mencegah metrik QPU ditampilkan untuk QPU di region eu-de.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation reminder: The deprecation date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Pengingat deprecation: Tanggal deprecation untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic telah ditetapkan pada 1 Juli 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"
msgstr "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_kyiv` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "`ibm_kyiv` telah dipensiunkan dan tidak akan lagi menerima pengiriman workload. Workload yang sudah masuk antrean di QPU ini mungkin masih akan diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"
msgstr "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated navigation to remove duplicated pages:\n"
msgstr "Navigasi yang diperbarui untuk menghapus halaman yang duplikat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Administration section has been renamed \"Access management\" and now only focuses on managing users and access groups.\n"
msgstr "Bagian Administration telah diganti nama menjadi \"Access management\" dan kini hanya berfokus pada pengelolaan pengguna dan grup akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is only one page each for managing instances and workloads; there are no longer separate pages for each in the Administration section.  Instead, what you can view and manage on each page is dependent on your access and permissions.\n"
msgstr "Hanya ada satu halaman masing-masing untuk mengelola instance dan workload; tidak ada lagi halaman terpisah untuk masing-masing di bagian Administration. Sebagai gantinya, apa yang dapat Anda lihat dan kelola pada setiap halaman bergantung pada akses dan izin Anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The analytics page (visible only to those with certain access) has been moved into the main navigation menu, to make it easier to find.\n"
msgstr "Halaman analitik (hanya terlihat oleh mereka yang memiliki akses tertentu) telah dipindahkan ke menu navigasi utama, agar lebih mudah ditemukan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launched two new QPUs: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) and ibm_kingston (us-east region)\n"
msgstr "Meluncurkan dua QPU baru: ibm_aachen (region eu-de) dan ibm_kingston (region us-east)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individuals who can view the analytics page can now filter the data to view information per plan.\n"
msgstr "Individu yang dapat melihat halaman analitik kini dapat memfilter data untuk melihat informasi per paket.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrators can now more easily add multiple individuals to an access group due to the addition of an existing account members table.\n"
msgstr "Administrator kini dapat lebih mudah menambahkan beberapa individu ke grup akses berkat penambahan tabel anggota akun yang sudah ada.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium plan instance administrators can set the instance allocation as a usage limit, so that usage in those instances cannot exceed the time alloted. See the [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits) guide for instructions.\n"
msgstr "Administrator instance Premium Plan kini dapat menetapkan alokasi instance sebagai batas penggunaan, sehingga penggunaan pada instance tersebut tidak dapat melebihi waktu yang dialokasikan. Lihat panduan [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits) untuk instruksinya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the sunset date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa tanggal sunset untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic telah ditetapkan pada 1 Juli 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"
msgstr "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two new 156Q Heron R2 QPUs, [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), located in the EU region, and [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), located in the US region, are now available.\n"
msgstr "Dua QPU Heron R2 156Q baru, [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), berlokasi di region EU, dan [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), berlokasi di region AS, kini tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View the systems you have access to with your selected instance in the [Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat sistem yang dapat Anda akses dengan instance yang dipilih di halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) pada IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal Pertama\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 March 2025 {#27-march-2025}"
msgstr "27 Maret 2025 {#27-march-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost limits for Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pay-As-You-Go Plan users with sufficient access can now view and edit [maximum cost limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) for their instances.\n"
msgstr "**Batas biaya untuk Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pengguna Pay-As-You-Go Plan dengan akses yang cukup kini dapat melihat dan mengedit [batas biaya maksimum](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) untuk instance mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Job management updates** - Now only administrators can delete workloads created by other users in an account, and collaborators will only be able to delete their own workloads.\n"
msgstr "**Pembaruan pengelolaan job** - Sekarang hanya administrator yang dapat menghapus workload yang dibuat oleh pengguna lain dalam suatu akun, dan kolaborator hanya akan dapat menghapus workload milik mereka sendiri.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr "**Pesan error autentikasi yang diperbarui** - Pesan error telah ditingkatkan untuk proses akun dan autentikasi guna mengurangi masalah pada alur pendaftaran. [Halaman Support](/guides/support) telah diperluas dengan rekomendasi untuk pemecahan masalah dan penyelesaian error umum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
msgstr "**Peningkatan retensi data default** - Periode retensi data default untuk IBM Quantum Platform baru telah ditingkatkan menjadi tiga tahun, naik dari satu tahun pada IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resolved inconsistent behavior due to caching** - Some inconsistent behavior seen when updating instance limits, tags, and QPU resources has been resolved, which was due to caching.\n"
msgstr "**Menyelesaikan perilaku tidak konsisten akibat caching** - Beberapa perilaku tidak konsisten yang terlihat saat memperbarui batas instance, tag, dan sumber daya QPU telah diselesaikan, yang disebabkan oleh caching.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For full details on the early access release and upcoming improvements, [check out the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"
msgstr "Untuk detail lengkap tentang rilis akses awal dan peningkatan mendatang, [lihat blog ini](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "25 March 2025 {#25-march-2025}"
msgstr "25 Maret 2025 {#25-march-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Network exclusive: Join us for our first quarterly IBM Quantum Product Updates Webinar, a series in which we unveil the latest advancements in our products and offerings, showcase partner use cases, and provide the opportunity for Q&A with quantum experts.\n"
msgstr "Eksklusif untuk IBM Quantum Network: Bergabunglah dengan kami dalam Webinar Pembaruan Produk IBM Quantum kuartalan pertama kami, sebuah rangkaian di mana kami mengungkap kemajuan terbaru dalam produk dan penawaran kami, menampilkan use case dari partner, dan memberikan kesempatan untuk Tanya Jawab dengan para pakar kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the first segment, we will talk about the evolution coming to IBM Quantum Platform that is designed to enhance security, stability, and user experience. Our team will walk through the key updates, demonstrate new capabilities, and discuss how these improvements empower developers and users alike.\n"
msgstr "Pada segmen pertama, kami akan membahas evolusi yang akan datang pada IBM Quantum Platform yang dirancang untuk meningkatkan keamanan, stabilitas, dan pengalaman pengguna. Tim kami akan menjelaskan pembaruan utama, mendemonstrasikan kemampuan baru, dan membahas bagaimana peningkatan ini memberdayakan developer dan pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second segment will feature the launch of three new and innovative Qiskit Functions in the Qiskit Functions Catalog. Each function provider will present their solution, highlighting its unique features, use cases, and impact on the broader ecosystem. Attendees will gain firsthand insights into how these Qiskit Functions can be leveraged for real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Segmen kedua akan menampilkan peluncuran tiga Qiskit Functions baru dan inovatif di Qiskit Functions Catalog. Setiap penyedia fungsi akan mempresentasikan solusi mereka, menyoroti fitur unik, use case, dan dampaknya pada ekosistem yang lebih luas. Peserta akan mendapatkan wawasan langsung tentang bagaimana Qiskit Functions ini dapat dimanfaatkan untuk aplikasi dunia nyata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn more and register today](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"
msgstr "[Pelajari lebih lanjut dan daftar hari ini](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "26 February 2025 {#26-february-2025}"
msgstr "26 Februari 2025 {#26-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are releasing an early access version of the upgraded experience, and invite you to [open an account and explore the new interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). We will continue to roll out updates over the coming months, with the end goal of creating an experience that looks and feels like the classic version of IBM Quantum Platform, but with greater functionality. We will eventually sunset IBM Quantum Platform classic, so stay tuned for updates.\n"
msgstr "Hari ini, kami merilis versi akses awal dari pengalaman yang ditingkatkan, dan mengundang Anda untuk [membuka akun dan menjelajahi antarmuka baru](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Kami akan terus meluncurkan pembaruan dalam beberapa bulan mendatang, dengan tujuan akhir menciptakan pengalaman yang terlihat dan terasa seperti versi klasik IBM Quantum Platform, tetapi dengan fungsionalitas yang lebih besar. Kami pada akhirnya akan menghentikan IBM Quantum Platform classic, jadi tunggu pembaruan berikutnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note: If your IBM Quantum Platform access falls under a plan administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, etc.), you will receive guided migration support through your administrator in the coming months. In the meantime, you are welcome to [create a free Open Plan account to explore the new platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Perlu diperhatikan: Jika akses IBM Quantum Platform Anda berada di bawah administrator paket (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, dll.), Anda akan menerima dukungan migrasi terbimbing melalui administrator Anda dalam beberapa bulan mendatang. Sementara itu, Anda dipersilakan untuk [membuat akun Open Plan gratis untuk menjelajahi platform baru](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 February 2025 {#24-february-2025}"
msgstr "24 Februari 2025 {#24-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our inventory is getting a makeover, and we will be retiring the following QPUs on or around 18 April 2025:\n"
msgstr "Inventaris kami sedang mendapatkan pembaruan tampilan, dan kami akan mempensiunkan QPU berikut pada atau sekitar 18 April 2025:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "ibm_kyiv\n"
msgstr "ibm_kyiv\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: ibm_sherbrooke will stay active for several more weeks after 18 April 2025.\n"
msgstr "~ibm_sherbrooke~ PEMBARUAN: ibm_sherbrooke akan tetap aktif selama beberapa minggu lagi setelah 18 April 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before these QPUs are retired.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan untuk mengambil data job dari job penting sebelumnya sebelum QPU ini dipensiunkan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 February 2025 {#3-february-2025}"
msgstr "3 Februari 2025 {#3-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pulse-level control on all IBM Quantum processors has been removed.  Additionally, the pulse module is scheduled for removal in Qiskit SDK v2.0.  Instead, you can use fractional gates that are now built into the Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). For full details and help migrating your code, refer to [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr "Kontrol tingkat pulse pada semua prosesor IBM Quantum telah dihapus. Selain itu, modul pulse dijadwalkan untuk dihapus di Qiskit SDK v2.0. Sebagai gantinya, Anda dapat menggunakan fractional gate yang kini terintegrasi ke dalam Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). Untuk detail lengkap dan bantuan migrasi kode Anda, lihat [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2 February 2025 {#2-february-2025}"
msgstr "2 Februari 2025 {#2-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Starting 2 June 2025 and continuing through the year, IBM Quantum will begin a gradual rollout of new features to [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) that will enable them at the utility scale.\n"
"Improvements include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Mulai 2 Juni 2025 dan berlanjut sepanjang tahun, IBM Quantum akan memulai peluncuran bertahap fitur baru untuk [sirkuit dinamis](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) yang akan mengaktifkannya pada skala utilitas.\n"
"Peningkatan meliputi hal berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 75x speedup in execution by using the Gen3 engine stack\n"
msgstr "Percepatan eksekusi 75x dengan menggunakan stack engine Gen3\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel execution of branches, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Eksekusi paralel cabang, yang mengurangi durasi sirkuit dan meningkatkan kualitas hasil\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improvement in mid-circuit measurement\n"
msgstr "Peningkatan pada pengukuran mid-circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Better integration with dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr "Integrasi yang lebih baik dengan dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "More visibility of circuit timing information\n"
msgstr "Visibilitas informasi timing circuit yang lebih baik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To accelerate the rollout, the following capabilities are now deprecated and will be no longer supported on or around 2 June 2025:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mempercepat peluncuran, kemampuan berikut kini tidak lagi didukung dan tidak akan didukung lagi pada atau sekitar 2 Juni 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `while`, `for`, and `switch` control flow constructs\n"
msgstr "Konstruksi control flow `while`, `for`, dan `switch`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ability to use control flow instructions inside the body of a branch (as in, nested control flow)\n"
msgstr "Kemampuan untuk menggunakan instruksi control flow di dalam body dari sebuah branch (yaitu, nested control flow)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional measurements\n"
msgstr "Pengukuran kondisional\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "7 January 2025 {#7-january-2025}"
msgstr "7 Januari 2025 {#7-january-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The rollout of the Gen3 engine stack begins today. This engine stack gives a 75x speedup in execution.  The rollout will be done on one QPU at a time, where a percentage of the jobs on the QPU will use the Gen3 path.  You can also force the Gen3 path using the `gen3-turbo` experimental option. Note that this engine stack is not compatible with fractional gates, pulse gates, or dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Peluncuran engine stack Gen3 dimulai hari ini. Engine stack ini memberikan percepatan 75x dalam eksekusi. Peluncuran akan dilakukan pada satu QPU dalam satu waktu, di mana sebagian persentase job pada QPU tersebut akan menggunakan jalur Gen3. Kamu juga bisa memaksa jalur Gen3 dengan menggunakan opsi eksperimental `gen3-turbo`. Perhatikan bahwa engine stack ini tidak kompatibel dengan fractional gates, pulse gates, atau dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

