#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2024 {#2024}"
msgstr "2024 {#2024}"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 October 2024 {#15-october-2024}"
msgstr "15 Oktober 2024 {#15-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `backend.run` has ended.\n"
msgstr "Dukungan untuk `backend.run` telah berakhir.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 October 2024 {#1-october-2024}"
msgstr "1 Oktober 2024 {#1-october-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Parameterized delay gates have been deprecated.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Parameterized delay gates telah tidak digunakan lagi (deprecated).\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal ketiga\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 August 2024 {#15-august-2024}"
msgstr "15 Agustus 2024 {#15-august-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available for Estimator V2. See the [`ZneOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr "Metode mitigasi error probabilistic error amplification (PEA) kini tersedia untuk Estimator V2. Lihat [referensi API `ZneOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new helper program `noise-learner` is now available. It allows characterizing the noise processes affecting the gates in one or more circuits of interest, based on the Pauli-Lindblad noise model. The output noise model can then be passed to Estimator via the `layer_noise_model` option.\n"
msgstr "Program pembantu baru `noise-learner` kini tersedia. Program ini memungkinkan karakterisasi proses noise yang mempengaruhi gate dalam satu atau lebih circuit yang diminati, berdasarkan model noise Pauli-Lindblad. Model noise hasilnya kemudian dapat diteruskan ke Estimator melalui opsi `layer_noise_model`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "V1 primitives are no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "Primitif V1 tidak lagi didukung.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 July 2024 {#3-july-2024}"
msgstr "3 Juli 2024 {#3-july-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following endpoints are deprecated and will be removed on or after 3 October 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` and `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. This removal has the following impacts:\n"
msgstr "Endpoint berikut tidak lagi digunakan (deprecated) dan akan dihapus pada atau setelah 3 Oktober 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` dan `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. Penghapusan ini memiliki dampak berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the endpoints are removed, `job.stream_results()` and `job.interim_results()` will be removed from the [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"
msgstr "Setelah endpoint dihapus, `job.stream_results()` dan `job.interim_results()` akan dihapus dari client [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - Additional methods, such as `job.result()` currently use the deprecated endpoints.  Upgrade to `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 or later before the endpoints are removed to avoid disruption.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Metode tambahan, seperti `job.result()`, saat ini menggunakan endpoint yang tidak lagi digunakan (deprecated). Upgrade ke `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 atau versi yang lebih baru sebelum endpoint dihapus untuk menghindari gangguan.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal kedua\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "18 June 2024 {#18-june-2024}"
msgstr "18 Juni 2024 {#18-june-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `optimization_level` option is deprecated for Estimator V2 and will be removed no sooner than 30 September 2024.\n"
msgstr "Opsi `optimization_level` tidak lagi digunakan (deprecated) untuk Estimator V2 dan akan dihapus paling cepat pada 30 September 2024.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 June 2024 {#3-june-2024}"
msgstr "3 Juni 2024 {#3-june-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available as an experimental option for Estimator V2. See the [`EstimatorOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) for more details.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Metode mitigasi error probabilistic error amplification (PEA) kini tersedia sebagai opsi eksperimental untuk Estimator V2. Lihat [referensi API `EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Kuartal pertama\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 March 2024 {#28-march-2024}"
msgstr "28 Maret 2024 {#28-march-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Qiskit Runtime primitives now support OpenQASM 3 as the input format for circuits and standard JSON output format. See [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) for examples.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Primitif Qiskit Runtime kini mendukung OpenQASM 3 sebagai format input untuk circuit dan format output JSON standar. Lihat [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) untuk contoh.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
